5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to play with everyone! I'm going to be the best detective ever and find the werewolf! Who wants to help me?,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,"I'll help you, Sakura! It sounds like a lot of fun. I don't know how to be a detective, but I'll do my best to find the werewolf with everyone!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'll help too! But we have to be careful. The werewolf is probably hiding right in front of us, pretending to be nice. I'm not letting them win!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,I'm in too! Let's all work together and make this a great game! I'll be watching everyone closely to see if I can spot any clues. This is going to be so much fun!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Such enthusiasm is almost overwhelming. Let's try to keep our heads clear. Logic and observation will be far more useful than excitement if we actually intend to find the werewolf.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're so serious! You sound like a teacher! But that's okay, maybe your big brain can help us find the clues! Do you have a secret plan already?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minato,,"A secret plan? That sounds exciting! I wonder what kind of plan Shion has. I want to learn how to find clues too, so please tell us if you have a good idea!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, don't be so naive! A ""secret plan"" might just be a way to trick us. We should be questioning everything, not just following whoever sounds the smartest. Right, Shion?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're so intense! But maybe that's a good thing! Let's just be friendly for now. I think we can trust each other while we figure things out. What do you think, Shion?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Trust is a luxury we cannot afford in this game, Mio. As for a plan, it's simple: observe the patterns of speech and look for contradictions. For now, I'll just be watching.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Watching patterns sounds like a puzzle! I'm really good at puzzles! I'll watch everyone's faces and see if anyone looks like they're hiding a big, scary secret! Hehe!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minato,,I'll try to watch faces too! But I'm not very good at it... maybe I can just listen to how everyone talks? I hope we can all be friends while we play!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, stop talking about being friends! This is a game of survival. If we're too soft, the werewolf is just going to eat us all. We need to be tough and stay alert!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're always so worried! But being tough doesn't mean we can't be nice. I think we'll find the werewolf faster if we're all happy and talking openly! Don't you agree, Minato?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Happiness is irrelevant to the outcome of this game. While you all enjoy the social aspect, I'll be focusing on the inconsistencies. Let's see who slips up first.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, Shion is still being a grumpy-pants! But I'm ready for the puzzle! I'll be the best helper ever! Let's all have a super fun time tomorrow!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Minato,,I hope everyone has a good night! I'm looking forward to seeing what happens tomorrow. Let's all try our best to help the village!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready for tomorrow. Just remember, don't let your guard down for a second. I'll be watching everyone to make sure no one is lying to us.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Mio,,I'm ready too! I'll be dreaming of clues tonight! Let's all have a good sleep so we can be super sharp tomorrow. Goodnight everyone!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Shion,,"The noise is quite exhausting. I'll be spending the night analyzing your behavior. Sleep well, everyone; I look forward to seeing who among you begins to falter tomorrow.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
