36,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning everyone! Did you all have sweet dreams? I'm so excited! I wonder if the Seer found a big clue last night! Does anyone have any secrets to tell us?,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Good morning, Sakura! I slept well, thank you. I'm curious too... I wonder if the Seer found something. If you have a clue, please tell us so we can save the village together!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Stop asking for secrets so nicely! If the Seer found something, they'll tell us when they're ready. For now, I'm watching you all. Anyone acting too nervous is already suspicious in my book!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Good morning! I slept great! @Takumi, you're still so grumpy! Let's start the day with a smile! I wonder if anyone wants to share their thoughts on who seems a bit suspicious so far?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Shion,,"It is far too early for guesswork, Mio. We have no deaths and no claims. The most logical move is to wait for the Seer to speak or for someone to make a slip of the tongue.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're always waiting for things to happen! That's boring! Maybe the Seer is just shy? Come on, if you're the Seer, you can tell me! I'm really good at keeping secrets, hehe!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Minato,,"Maybe the Seer is a little nervous? I understand how that feels. If you're the Seer, you don't have to be scared! We're all here to help, so you can tell us whenever you feel ready.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, you're too soft! The Seer isn't ""nervous,"" they're probably calculating the best time to speak. But if the werewolf is among us, they're probably pretending to be just as ""nice"" as you are right now!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're making everyone sound suspicious! But you're right that the werewolf is hiding. Since I'm the Seer, I can actually help us out! I checked Shion last night, and he's human! That's a start, right?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Shion,,"A claim so early. While it's helpful to have a confirmed human, Mio, your timing is quite convenient. Are you truly the Seer, or are you simply trying to secure my trust to divert suspicion from yourself?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Wow! Mio is the Seer! That's so cool! @Shion, don't be such a grumpy-pants! Mio is just trying to help us! If Shion is human, then we have one less person to worry about, right? Yay!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Minato,,"That's wonderful news! Thank you for telling us, Mio. I'm glad Shion is human. Does that mean we can all trust each other a little more now? I hope we can find the werewolf together!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, you're claiming to be the Seer already? That's way too fast! You're just trying to make us trust you so we don't look at you. @Shion is right to be suspicious. This could be a total trap!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, it's not a trap! I just wanted to give us a good start so we don't waste time. I'm being honest! Why is it so hard to believe me? I really want us to win together!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your skepticism is grounded, but let's look at the logic. If Mio is the werewolf, claiming the Seer role and clearing me is a gamble to build a shield. However, if she is the Seer, she's simply being efficient. I'm still observing.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I think we should believe Mio! She's so sweet, she wouldn't lie to us! @Takumi, stop being so mean to her! Let's just trust the Seer and be happy that Shion is a good guy! Hehe!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I agree with Sakura. Mio seems very kind, and I want to believe her. If she's the Seer, she's helping us a lot! @Takumi, please don't be so angry. Maybe we can all just trust Mio?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not being mean, I'm being smart! Trusting someone just because they're ""sweet"" is exactly how the werewolf wins. @Mio, your act isn't fooling me. I'm not voting for anyone until I'm sure, but I'm keeping my eyes on you!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're so stubborn! But it's okay, I can handle it! I'm just trying my best to help everyone. Since we have to vote today, maybe we should think about who else seems a bit off? I'm definitely not the werewolf!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The conversation has devolved into emotional appeals and baseless suspicion. Since Mio has cleared me, the focus shifts to the others. Takumi's aggression is predictable, but Minato's excessive softness is equally suspicious. I'll abstain from a definitive choice for now.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
